   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDC made its first investment of $15.0 million in Takura II in 2013. In 2016 we committed an additional $7.5 million to the fund as part of a $25 million rights issue, which boosted the size of the fund from $50 million to $75 million. The fund looks to make investments of between $3 million to $7 million.&#xa0; Our investment will provide a much-needed pipeline of finance for businesses that are key to Zimbabwe&#x2019;s economic recovery and the economic resurgence in the SADC.</narrative>
   </description>
